{"about_the_game":"Transcend to another world and meet three girls with distinct personalities: the clumsy priest, the mage with twin souls, and the shy succubus. Embark on various adventures with them, and you may gain unexpected rewards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726 Game Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2606 Freely Customizable Battle Card Gameplay</h2>Each class comes with its own unique deck and starting conditions. Every turn is governed by action points and rage levels.<br>Make the most of your class advantages to build your deck strategically and adapt on the fly!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633120/extras/a2a222108bd08facbc08992e6d3a7955.avif?t=1773399034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2606 Real-time rendering of interactive foreplay and petting gameplay.</h2>Touch the girls' bodies with your hands and tongue, and peel off their clothes to heighten their excitement!<br>You can also zoom in and adjust the size and angle of the area you want to admire more closely. Once the excitement level is reached, you can engage in formal sexual interaction...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633120/extras/747a223194263d47c90c4a4e5db34f01.avif?t=1773399034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2606 Quest Navigation System</h2>Not sure what to do next? With this system, you'll know exactly what conditions and targets are required to trigger missions.<br>Progressing through the story has never been easier!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633120/extras/9bc6d369224f812b542609a7222ce07d.avif?t=1773399034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2606 Three Distinct Heroines You Can Romance!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clumsy Saint &quot;